WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.409
Zann and his friends careened through the vortex.

2
00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:08.205
They were moving so fast that the passing wormholes all blurred together.

3
00:00:08.206 --> 00:00:11.609
Seconds later they crashed into another world.

4
00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:16.010
There had been no chance of holding onto the edge of the wormhole this time.

5
00:00:16.011 --> 00:00:20.225
Zann felt himself fly at least a dozen yards into the new world.

6
00:00:20.226 --> 00:00:21.980
Splash

7
00:00:21.981 --> 00:00:25.013
! "Drat!" Zann sat up and looked

8
00:00:25.014 --> 00:00:28.940
around. The first thing he saw was the bright blue sky

9
00:00:28.941 --> 00:00:34.059
overhead. Then he noticed a wormhole winking right beside the stream he was sitting

10
00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:37.653
in. That was weird. How could it still be so

11
00:00:37.654 --> 00:00:41.005
close? "Zann!" Perda cried.

12
00:00:41.006 --> 00:00:47.081
"Look!" She pointed at some houses nearby. They were no taller than Zann's

13
00:00:47.082 --> 00:00:50.804
knee. "Yes!" Zann cried. "We're here—oof!"

14
00:00:50.805 --> 00:00:54.695
He was yanked off his feet. Mother's spell was still working!

15
00:00:54.696 --> 00:01:01.279
The message stone pulled Zann and the others through the forest at such speed that Zann felt dizzy.

16
00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:02.701
Thump

17
00:01:02.702 --> 00:01:06.948
! "Ouch!" Zann blurted out as he bumped into

18
00:01:06.949 --> 00:01:12.724
something. "Hey!" a disgruntled voice complained. "Watch where you're

19
00:01:12.725 --> 00:01:17.549
going." Even before the person turned around, Zann knew exactly who it

20
00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:20.624
was. "Wyssa!" He gasped. "Oh

21
00:01:20.625 --> 00:01:24.906
no!" "What are you kids doing here?" Wyssa

22
00:01:24.907 --> 00:01:28.962
demanded. "You?" Perda frowned at Wyssa as she brushed herself

23
00:01:28.963 --> 00:01:33.081
off. Zann felt his heart sink as he realized the

24
00:01:33.082 --> 00:01:39.629
mistake. "Mother's magic brought us to the stone's rightful owner—the last person who possessed

25
00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:44.498
it." "Wyssa," Darb said, realization dawning on his

26
00:01:44.499 --> 00:01:51.213
face. Zann nodded, feeling crushed. "I can't believe I got my hopes up," he

27
00:01:51.214 --> 00:01:55.258
mumbled. "Stupid spell!" He tossed the message stone

28
00:01:55.259 --> 00:02:00.999
away. Perda grabbed it. "You should keep the stone. It could still be a

29
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:05.298
clue." Zann frowned. "I never want to see that thing

30
00:02:05.299 --> 00:02:08.981
again." Perda shrugged and tucked the stone into her own

31
00:02:08.982 --> 00:02:15.517
pocket. Wyssa was glaring at all of them. "Well? Why aren't you kids in

32
00:02:15.518 --> 00:02:18.993
Magica?" Gliss took a step backward. "Um . .

33
00:02:18.994 --> 00:02:23.115
." "Oh, never mind." Wyssa waved a gnarled

34
00:02:23.116 --> 00:02:27.546
hand. "I don't care. The important thing is I've found

35
00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:34.247
him! I've traced Morb to this world!" Her eyes glittered

36
00:02:34.248 --> 00:02:40.174
angrily. "Really?" Zann still felt disappointed. But maybe all hope wasn't lost.

37
00:02:40.175 --> 00:02:46.259
At least they'd found Wyssa. And if Morb was here, maybe Zann's parents were too.

38
00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:49.427
"Is this World X?" Gliss asked.

39
00:02:49.428 --> 00:02:54.718
"I believe so. Look!" Wyssa snapped her fingers.

40
00:02:54.719 --> 00:02:59.509
Dozens of wormholes instantly winked into sight all around them!

41
00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:03.935
Zann glanced into the nearest one. "That is so weird.

42
00:03:03.936 --> 00:03:08.426
I don't see the vortex at all. Just a bunch of trees."

43
00:03:08.427 --> 00:03:11.841
"I see a dragon through this one!" Gliss said.

44
00:03:11.842 --> 00:03:19.567
"It's true!" Perda looked awed. "The wormholes here lead directly into other worlds."

45
00:03:19.568 --> 00:03:26.026
"Wow." Darb said. "So we could step straight back into Magica if we found the right wormhole?"

46
00:03:26.027 --> 00:03:31.179
"Yes!" Gliss sounded excited. "I wonder how we could find it?"

47
00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:37.779
Zann ignored them. "So where's Morb?" he asked Wyssa. "How do you know he's here?"

48
00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:41.965
"I have my ways." Wyssa looked grim.

49
00:03:41.966 --> 00:03:51.914
"When I find him, I'm going to drag him straight through to Fardark, where I'll feed him to the first scatter beast I find!"

50
00:03:51.915 --> 00:03:56.072
Zann gulped, thinking back to his time in Fardark.

51
00:03:56.073 --> 00:04:01.245
For a second he almost felt sorry for Morb. Almost

52
00:04:01.246 --> 00:04:06.834
. Just then a tiny man hurried into view. "Wyssa!" he

53
00:04:06.835 --> 00:04:14.947
exclaimed. "I have news." He stopped short when he noticed Zann and the others. "Oh, you have

54
00:04:14.948 --> 00:04:22.306
company." "Never mind them," Wyssa said. "Tell me what you know, Whistlefeather. Is he

55
00:04:22.307 --> 00:04:28.099
here?" "Yes," Whistlefeather said fearfully. "Morb is indeed here in

56
00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:31.908
Rood. And we've heard that he's brought prisoners from Magica with him!"

57
00:04:31.909 --> 00:04:37.708
"Prisoners from Magica?" Zann blurted out. "That's got to be my parents!"

58
00:04:37.709 --> 00:04:41.594
He grabbed Wyssa's sleeve. "We have to find them!"

59
00:04:41.595 --> 00:04:45.697
"Thank you, my friend," Wyssa said to Whistlefeather.

60
00:04:45.698 --> 00:04:52.046
She shook off Zann's hand. Then, snapping her fingers, she zapped out of sight.

61
00:04:52.047 --> 00:04:54.159
"No!" Zann cried.

62
00:04:54.160 --> 00:05:00.825
"It's okay, Zann." Perda reached into her pocket. "We still have this, remember?"

63
00:05:00.826 --> 00:05:07.398
Zann and his friends barely had time to grab one another before they were whisked off again by Mother's spell.

64
00:05:07.399 --> 00:05:14.360
They flew through the forest and up a steep hill before coming to an abrupt stop at a wall of rocks.

65
00:05:14.361 --> 00:05:21.115
"You again!" Wyssa didn't seem pleased to see them. "Hush, or he'll hear us."

66
00:05:21.116 --> 00:05:28.779
Zann glanced around. The rocks led to a gorge, on the other side of which was a massive waterfall.

67
00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:32.529
Over the roar of the water, he could hear voices.

68
00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:37.552
Zann peeked over the rocks and gasped. It was Morb!

69
00:05:37.553 --> 00:05:40.696
"Keep your head down!" Wyssa hissed.

70
00:05:40.697 --> 00:05:45.089
Another person stood between the evil villain and the edge of the cliff.

71
00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:51.468
"Oh!" Gliss whispered, peering out beside Zann. "Is that Venna?"

72
00:05:51.469 --> 00:05:55.295
Venna was staring at Morb, looking terrified.

73
00:05:55.296 --> 00:06:00.044
"You can't do this!" she cried. "It's not right!"

74
00:06:00.045 --> 00:06:03.869
Morb lifted a hand and rubbed his fingers together.

75
00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:09.081
" I'm the one who decides what's right around here," he

76
00:06:09.082 --> 00:06:13.417
sneered. "Now prepare to go for a little

77
00:06:13.418 --> 00:06:21.716
swim." Venna glanced fearfully down at the water behind her. "No—p-please," she stammered.

78
00:06:21.717 --> 00:06:25.510
"Why is she so scared?" Perda whispered.

79
00:06:25.511 --> 00:06:29.723
"She must still not have magic," said Gliss.

80
00:06:29.724 --> 00:06:36.166
"But she doesn't need magic to swim." Perda sidled closer to the cliff's edge.

81
00:06:36.167 --> 00:06:43.150
When she looked down, she saw why Venna was so scared. "Oh no!"

82
00:06:43.151 --> 00:06:50.574
"What?" Zann moved over to peer down as well. "Oh, wow—is that a gulper?"

83
00:06:50.575 --> 00:06:55.425
"I guess now we know why Morb went to Skellia," Darb said grimly.

84
00:06:55.426 --> 00:07:00.748
"You have to stop him!" Zann urged Wyssa. "You have to save Venna!"

85
00:07:00.749 --> 00:07:05.422
But it was too late. Just then Morb snapped his fingers.

86
00:07:05.423 --> 00:07:17.242
Venna screamed as magic energy shot from Morb's hand, sending her tumbling down into the gulper's waiting jaws!

